SDL2_mixer 2.8.2 for Pyxis
Upstream: https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL_mixer.git
Revision: b208916aed9250fe434360e6c6a95f0697bb7b01 (tag release-2.8.2)

SDL2_mixer is built unchanged, under the zlib license in LICENSE.txt.
Original Pyxis recipe and development metadata are covered by MPL-2.0;
see MPL-2.0 and LICENSING.md.

The static profile uses the separate Pyxis SDL2 port and enables WAV music,
WAV/AIFF/VOC samples and the mixer API. MIDI, FLAC, GME, MOD, MP3, Opus,
Vorbis, WavPack, external music commands, shared libraries and samples are
disabled. No vendored codec libraries or game data are built or shipped.
